        <item>
            <title>1.0.78</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>While you were away.</strong> When you turn off Privacy Mode, a card lists any mail that came in while it was on. Click a conversation to open it.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy License works again.</strong> The button now opens the checkout page instead of a "page not found" error.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
