        <item>
            <title>1.0.77</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>New tooltips.</strong> Rest on a button and its name now appears in a small dark label above it. The labels show up faster and are shorter.</li>
<li><strong>Privacy Mode is smoother.</strong> The blur fades in and out, and compose windows no longer jump in size.</li>
<li><strong>Move windows in Privacy Mode.</strong> Drag anywhere on the blurred window to move it.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
