            <title>1.0.76</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Privacy Mode hides the toolbar too.</strong> While it's on, each window shows only the blur and a <strong>Show Mail</strong> button. Press ⌃⌘P or click Show Mail to bring everything back.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
